==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*4 [[One Horn]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*6 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 23.33~30 seconds<sup>700f~900f</sup>.
*3 [[Shy Boy]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[THE SLOTH]] spawns as the boss after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Use your [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Island Cat]] and any other [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|Anti-Red Cats]] to kill red enemies while dealing damage to THE SLOTH. Use money from the defeated enemies to spam [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Lion Cats]] so they can chip away at THE SLOTH's health

==Trivia==
*Stone in the Sword refers to [[Wikipedia:Excalibur|Excalibur]], a mythical sword that denotes the rightful King of Britain should someone pull it from an anvil sitting atop a stone.
**Additionally, combined with the stage's position on the map, it could also be referring to the Master Sword from The Legend of Zelda series.

